{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/2/db2a4aa3aa9a081f3fa0b39554cdd297537359c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Log_M{N}=Log_N{M},M \\ne N,MN&gt;0,M \\ne 1, N \\ne 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"409\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbcfabd65745f2b759dea1840f9a0753b2f992e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/a/52a1d63c605f645df8dc240d7db72cff6911db3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{1}{2} \\quad \\text{(B) } 1 \\quad \\text{(C) } 2 \\quad \\text{(D) } 10 \\\\ \\text{(E) a number greater than 2 and less than 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"331\" height=\"55\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we change the base of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/b/6bba33506c80fdeb081fae38cfb46b8a26f87ae7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Log_M{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> to base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/b/1fb22d0e24e396d29cd59dc07e639cae886d31a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{log_N{M}}= Log_N{M}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"145\" height=\"40\" />. Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/0050f6adbc62baf36bdb27a5c797ab781b66be70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Log_N{M}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/a/f7a913af73af57478eb6a786e337bfbba7638194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Log_N{M}^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/4/3a4c816a9e9d150c9764aad8c5712c7db1797a67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N\\not = M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7a936e07e0bc6866f1359893b27b93ed6263276.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Log_N{M}=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/9/c69c6d67ef9f461240877dd3b01085a4bbf3513e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N^{-1}=M \\rightarrow \\frac{1}{N} = M \\rightarrow MN=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"267\" height=\"37\" />. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\